     vveelllluumm , vveellppiicc , vveellddxxff , vveellcchheecckk , vveellddiiffff , llpprr

NNOOTTEESS
     The editor's Print item runs this program on a snapshot of
     the live drawing, so what the board prints and what a
     Makefile prints are the same bytes.

     The device backends share ONE object walker with the print-
     preview window, so what the preview shows is what the paper
     gets.
